==Scots==

===Noun===
{{sco-noun}}

(vulgar, slang, pejorative) Server of Her Majestys police force, low morals, if any, generally of hobo decent, not to be trusted with children or animals, suffer from 'little man' syndrome, closely associated with pond-life. In short a scrotum.

====Usage notes====
Often used pejoratively, in the same way that [[scrotum]] can be used pejoratively.

